ds_list_add(textList, "These shards are said to be the remains of the MALLET OF LEGEND.", "This Holy Relic might just be the blessed MALLET that saved our town.","The reason for Mallet Town's existence -- and this museum!", "Some self-proclaimed 'scientists' have debated the shards' authenticity..", "...They claim that both scientific tests and historical evidence indicate the Shards were made centuries more recently than the Hammer of Legend...", "But none of that accounts for,", "You know,","All those rumors that this is the MALLET OF LEGEND.", "So, you know, you be the judge.")